# Cursor Context: FretFlow – Modern Guitar Mentorship, E-Commerce & Academy SaaS (Plan Maksimum)

## 🎯 Project Overview (GrygielGitara – Production & Live SaaS)

**Goal:** Build a fully operational, production-ready web platform and business engine for **GrygielGitara** (`grygielgitara.pl`), serving as the central digital hub for Jakub Grygiel (Guitar Educator, Musician, and Certified Instrument Craft Technician in Gdańsk). The system is built to actively handle real-world student onboarding, automate daily business tasks, accept online payments, manage digital delivery, and serve as an enterprise-grade portfolio demonstrating full-stack engineering proficiency.

- **Primary Mission (Commercial & Operational):** Real-world client acquisition (Gdańsk in-person/home lessons & guitar setup service), automated digital product sales (E-books, online courses), streamlined student progress management, and hands-free transactional email workflows.
- **Brand & Domain:** **GrygielGitara** (`grygielgitara.pl`) – Personal brand combining zero-stress guitar mentorship, craftsmanship/setup services, and automated digital EdTech products.
- **Target Audience:** Real local guitar students (Gdańsk: studio near Galeria Forum / home visits), online course & e-book customers, active enrolled students in the Student Portal, and software engineering recruiters/technical leads evaluating full-stack TypeScript & SaaS architecture.
- **Tone & Style:** Innovative, modern, clean, unpretentious (zero-stress, practical approach), lightning-fast, and fully accessible.
- **Theme & Aesthetic:** Modern & Fresh Light Blue & White (`#0EA5E9` / `#00BFFF` Sky Blue accent, Crisp White `#FFFFFF` background, Slate `#0F172A` text, semi-transparent frosted glass elements).
- **Language:** Polish (UI Content & Customer Communications), English (Code, Commit Messages, Comments, and Technical Documentation).

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack & Architecture

- **Framework:** Next.js (App Router, Server Components, Server Actions, Route Handlers)
- **Language:** TypeScript (Strict Mode Enabled)
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS (Mobile-First approach)
- **UI & Icons:** Shadcn UI + Radix UI Primitives + Lucide React
- **Animations & UX:** Framer Motion (Scroll animations, micro-interactions, custom video UI)
- **Database & Auth:** Supabase (PostgreSQL, Row Level Security, Storage for PDF/Video assets, Auth for Admin & Students)
- **Payments:** Stripe API / Przelewy24 / PayU (Digital products & course access)
- **Email & Automation:** Resend API (Transactional emails) + MailerLite API (Newsletter & Lead delivery) + Vercel Cron / QStash (Scheduled message automations)
- **Form Handling:** React Hook Form + Zod (Strict schema validation)
- **Analytics:** Internal Supabase telemetry / PostHog (Tracking visits, conversions, sales, and leads)
- **Deployment:** Vercel

---

## 🏗️ Core Architecture & Features (Plan Maksimum)

### 1. Public & Client Experience (Landing, Mentorship & Interactive Booking)
- **Hero & Lead Magnet:** Interactive cover introducing the zero-stress guitar methodology, 7+ years of teaching experience, classical credentials (PSM II st. w Kaliszu), piano tuning background, and ensemble work (*The Medievals*). Includes an instant PDF Lead Magnet download ("Jak bezstresowo nastroić gitarę w 3 minuty").
- **Interactive Methodology & Craft Story:** Dynamic scroll-driven visual timeline using Framer Motion (`useScroll`, `useTransform`) highlighting ergonomics, custom video follow-ups, free string maintenance, and non-academic theory.
- **Interactive Contact Form (`/kontakt` or modal):**
  - Modern form with React Hook Form + Zod (Topic selection: Gdańsk lessons, Instrument setup, E-book/Course support, General inquiry).
  - Server Action handling instant Supabase database logging + automated Resend notification email sent to Jakub and confirmation email to the user.
- **Tokenized Dynamic Consultation / Trial Booking (`/rezerwacja/[token]` or `/rezerwacja`):**
  - Prospective students book/confirm trial lessons or guitar setup consultations using personalized tokens.
  - Multi-step form powered by React Hook Form & Zod (Lesson location: Gdańsk home/student home, instrument type, musical goals, favorite songs to learn, zero-risk guarantee confirmation).
  - Direct submission via **Next.js Server Actions** with immediate optimistic UI updates and toast notifications.
- **Shop & E-Books (`/sklep`):** Digital catalog for purchasing e-books and video courses with instant payment integration.
- **Interactive FAQ Accordion:** Common questions (Guitar pain/strings, lessons at home vs. studio near Galeria Forum, materials in price, 1st lesson guarantee).

### 2. Student Portal (`/strefa-studenta` / `/moje-kursy`)
- **Passwordless Auth:** Frictionless Magic Link login via Supabase Auth.
- **My Purchased Content:** User dashboard listing owned e-books (PDF download links via Supabase Storage Signed URLs) and unlocked video courses.
- **Interactive Video Player & Progress Tracker:** Custom video player with lesson navigation, attached tabs/resources download, and lesson completion toggles (`useOptimistic`).

### 3. Automated Messaging & Notification Engine (Future-Proof Architecture)
- **Event-Driven Emails:** Instant execution on actions (Form submitted, Booking created, Course purchased, Lead magnet downloaded).
- **Scheduled Reminders (Cron/Queue):** Background tasks for sending upcoming lesson reminders 24h prior or automated follow-up messages after trial sessions.

### 4. Admin Dashboard (`/admin`)
- **Protected Authentication:** Secured via Next.js Middleware and Supabase Auth.
- **Analytics & Sales Overview:** Real-time metrics tracking website visits, total sales revenue, e-book conversions, and email newsletter leads.
- **Booking & Student Management:** Real-time client list with search, status filtering (Confirmed, Pending, Completed), lesson location summary, and CSV export functionality.
- **Contact Inbox (`/admin/wiadomosci`):** Management panel for incoming contact form inquiries (Read/Unread status, quick reply trigger).
- **Content & Product Management:** CRUD interface for updating digital products (`products`), e-book files, and lesson videos.
- **Gallery & Storage Management:** UI for managing photo/video assets via Supabase Storage buckets.

---

## 🎨 Design Guidelines & UX Standards

### Color Palette ("Light Blue & White")
- **Primary / Accent Blue:** Vibrant Light Blue / Sky Blue (`#0EA5E9` or `#00BFFF`)
- **Secondary Blue:** Soft Muted Blue (`#BAE6FD` / `#E0F2FE`)
- **Background & Surfaces:** Crisp Pure White (`#FFFFFF`) & Ultra-light Off-White (`#F8FAFC`)
- **Frosted Glass (Glassmorphism):** `bg-white/70` with `backdrop-blur-md` for modern cards and sticky headers.
- **Text:** Dark Slate (`#0F172A`) for WCAG AAA contrast compliance.

### Typography
- **Headings:** Modern Display / Geometric Sans (e.g., `Plus Jakarta Sans` or `Geist Sans` via `next/font`)
- **Body:** Clean Sans-serif (e.g., `Inter` or `Geist Sans`)

### Engineering & UX Standards (Portfolio Focus)
- **Mobile-First Touch Targets:** Minimum interactive target sizes (44x44px).
- **Accessibility (a11y):** Full keyboard navigation, ARIA attributes, semantic HTML.
- **Zero Layout Shift:** Image aspect ratio reservations with blur placeholders (`next/image`).
- **Secure File Access:** Use Supabase signed URLs for paid PDF & video assets.
- **Type Safety:** End-to-end TypeScript types generated from Supabase DB schema.

---

## 🗄️ Database Schema & Security (Supabase PostgreSQL)

```sql
-- Enable UUID extension
create extension if not exists "uuid-ossp";

-- Products (E-books, Online Courses)
create table products (
  id uuid default gen_random_uuid() primary key,
  created_at timestamp with time zone default timezone('utc'::text, now()) not null,
  title text not null,
  slug text unique not null,
  description text,
  price_in_cents int not null,
  type text not null check (type in ('ebook', 'course', 'lesson_package')),
  file_path text,
  is_published boolean default false
);

-- Contact Form Messages
create table contact_messages (
  id uuid default gen_random_uuid() primary key,
  created_at timestamp with time zone default timezone('utc'::text, now()) not null,
  sender_name text not null,
  email text not null,
  phone text,
  topic text not null check (topic in ('lessons', 'setup_service', 'shop_support', 'other')),
  message text not null,
  is_read boolean default false not null
);

-- Lesson Bookings & Student Consultation Requests
create table bookings (
  id uuid default gen_random_uuid() primary key,
  token text unique not null,
  created_at timestamp with time zone default timezone('utc'::text, now()) not null,
  updated_at timestamp with time zone default timezone('utc'::text, now()) not null,
  student_name text not null,
  email text not null,
  phone text,
  location_type text check (location_type in ('student_home', 'studio_forum', 'online')),
  preferred_day text,
  favorite_song text,
  has_instrument boolean default true,
  status text default 'pending' check (status in ('pending', 'confirmed', 'cancelled', 'completed')),
  message text
);

-- User Access / Course Entitlements
create table user_entitlements (
  id uuid default gen_random_uuid() primary key,
  created_at timestamp with time zone default timezone('utc'::text, now()) not null,
  user_id uuid references auth.users(id) on delete cascade not null,
  product_id uuid references products(id) on delete cascade not null,
  unique(user_id, product_id)
);

-- Course Lessons
create table course_lessons (
  id uuid default gen_random_uuid() primary key,
  product_id uuid references products(id) on delete cascade not null,
  title text not null,
  slug text not null,
  description text,
  video_url text not null,
  attachment_path text,
  order_index int default 0 not null
);

-- Lesson Progress Tracker
create table lesson_progress (
  id uuid default gen_random_uuid() primary key,
  user_id uuid references auth.users(id) on delete cascade not null,
  lesson_id uuid references course_lessons(id) on delete cascade not null,
  completed boolean default true not null,
  completed_at timestamp with time zone default timezone('utc'::text, now()) not null,
  unique(user_id, lesson_id)
);

-- Email Leads / Newsletter List
create table newsletter_subscribers (
  id uuid default gen_random_uuid() primary key,
  created_at timestamp with time zone default timezone('utc'::text, now()) not null,
  email text unique not null,
  source text default 'tuning_pdf_lead_magnet'
);

-- Automated Notification Queue / Log
create table automated_notifications (
  id uuid default gen_random_uuid() primary key,
  created_at timestamp with time zone default timezone('utc'::text, now()) not null,
  recipient_email text not null,
  notification_type text not null, -- e.g., 'lesson_reminder_24h', 'post_lesson_video', 'booking_confirmation'
  scheduled_for timestamp with time zone not null,
  sent_at timestamp with time zone,
  status text default 'pending' check (status in ('pending', 'sent', 'failed'))
);

-- Website Traffic Analytics
create table page_views (
  id uuid default gen_random_uuid() primary key,
  created_at timestamp with time zone default timezone('utc'::text, now()) not null,
  path text not null,
  referrer text
);

-- Row Level Security (RLS) Configuration
alter table products enable row level security;
alter table contact_messages enable row level security;
alter table bookings enable row level security;
alter table user_entitlements enable row level security;
alter table lesson_progress enable row level security;
alter table newsletter_subscribers enable row level security;
alter table automated_notifications enable row level security;
alter table page_views enable row level security;

-- RLS Policies
create policy "Allow public read published products" on products for select using (is_published = true);
create policy "Allow public to insert contact messages" on contact_messages for insert with check (true);
create policy "Allow public to insert bookings" on bookings for insert with check (true);
create policy "Allow user read own entitlements" on user_entitlements for select using (auth.uid() = user_id);
create policy "Allow user read own lesson progress" on lesson_progress for select using (auth.uid() = user_id);
create policy "Allow user update own lesson progress" on lesson_progress for insert with check (auth.uid() = user_id);
create policy "Allow public to insert page views" on page_views for insert with check (true);
create policy "Allow public to subscribe to newsletter" on newsletter_subscribers for insert with check (true);

