# Cursor Context: FretFlow – Modern Guitar Mentorship, E-Commerce & Academy SaaS (Plan Maksimum)

## 🎯 Project Overview
**Goal:** Create a production-ready, full-stack educational and e-commerce SaaS platform built for Jakub Grygiel (Guitar Teacher, Musician, and Instrument Craft Technician in Gdańsk). Built from the ground up using **Plan Maksimum** architecture to serve as a high-impact portfolio project showcasing advanced Next.js App Router patterns, real-time database management, fine-grained access control, digital product sales, tokenized client onboarding, interactive contact modules, and automated messaging workflows.

- **Target Audience:** Potential guitar students (Gdańsk stacjonarnie/dojazd), digital product buyers (E-books, online courses), active students, and recruiters/engineers evaluating full-stack TypeScript, UX, and software engineering capabilities.
- **Tone & Style:** Innovative, modern, clean, unpretentious (zero-stress approach), performant, and fully accessible.
- **Theme & Aesthetic:** Modern & Fresh Light Blue & White (`#0EA5E9` / `#00BFFF` accent, Crisp White `#FFFFFF`, Slate `#0F172A` text, semi-transparent frosted glass elements).
- **Language:** Polish (UI Content & Customer Communications), English (Code, Commit Messages, Comments, and Technical Documentation).

---

